{title: Kodai Kaala Kaatre}
{artist: Panneer Pushpangal Ilaiyaraaja}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Kodai Kaala Kaatrae..        [E]Kulir Thendral Paadum Paattae
Manam Thaedum Suvai [G#m]yodu,        Thinam [C#m]thorum Isai [B]Paadu
Athai [F#]Kaetkum Nenjamae,        Sugam [G#]Kodi Kaanattum
Ivaigal Ila [C#m]maalai Pookka [F#m]lae,        Puthu [B]Cholai Pookka [E]laee
[E]Vaanil Pogum Maegum Ingae,        [E]Yaarai Thaedutho
[E]Vaasam Veesum Poovin Raagam,        [E]Yaarai Paadutho
Than [C#m]Unarvugalai Mellisaiyaaga,        [C#m]Nam Uravugalai Vanthu [B]Koodatho
Thiru [A]Naalum Koodattum,        [F#m]Sugam [B]Thaedi Aadattum [G#]
Ivaigal Ila [C#m]maalai pookka [F#m]lae,        Puthu [B]Cholai Pookka [E]laee
